            <value>At 9:54 p.m. Central Daylight Time Sunday, Environment Canada has issued a tornado warning for Westman Manitoba. Extra care and attention should be exercised in and around the following localities: . Environment Canada meteorologists are tracking a severe thunderstorm that is possibly producing a tornado. Damaging winds, large hail and locally intense rainfall are also possible. Take cover immediately if threatening weather approaches. Please consult local media for more information.</value>
